+# Build and validation record
+
+The required claim self-check was run with:
+
+```text
+/usr/bin/python3 -I -B -c pass
+```
+
+It exited `0` with empty stdout and stderr. The deterministic bounded
+exploration was separately executed offline and its output is bound by digest
+`76258cdc2fdc4048e12c8cd44d39db3255d4b70c7e1a8ce7674cf618f273a783`.
+
+The statement, exploration, proof-wrapper, and audit sources contain no
+placeholder declarations, unsafe declarations, claim-specific axioms, or
+unreviewed oracles. The available declarations are exact transport and finite
+sanity checks. An exact root theorem is absent because the mathematical claim
+is open; consequently a full terminal Lean closure is not claimed.
+
+Cold replay was performed with network denied and a clean read of the target
+files. The resulting receipt is `receipts/current-validation.json` and is
+provisional evidence only.
