+# S5-CLM-00003487
+
+Target-local conjecture package for
+`CunninghamChain.infinitely_many_firstKind_chains`.
+
+The package binds the exact FC-STATEMENT record, source locator, Stage6 alias,
+Lean statement transport, bounded exploration, typed resolution frontier,
+readable reconstruction, cold replay, and provisional handoff. The source
+claim is an open Cunningham-chain infinitude conjecture. No proof or refutation
+was found, so `machine_complete`, human resolution, and terminal RELEASE stay
+false/underscore. This is intentional and required by the execution contract.
+
+Only the target-local work root was changed. The canonical repository,
+Blueprint, Gantt, catalog, and controller surfaces were not modified.
